<%= tag.li(**step_options) do %>
  <%# `content?` only says that a block was passed, not that it rendered
      anything, so a host deciding inside the block took this branch on every
      step and the bare title below was unreachable. Same predicate, same
      reasoning as app/components/bali/workflow_steps/step/component.html.erb,
      whose comment carries the long version — including why prose in an ERB
      comment must never quote a closing delimiter. %>
  <% if sublabel.present? || content.present? %>
    <div>
      <div><%= title %></div>
      <% if sublabel.present? %>
        <div class="step-sublabel text-xs opacity-60"><%= sublabel %></div>
      <% end %>
      <%= content %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <%= title %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
